You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, provided you give appropriate
credit (see applications/sjsu/CITATION.cff), provide a link to the license, and indicate if
changes were made.

The scripts that generate these files (applications/sjsu/scripts/) are part of the KAM-dev
repository and are licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see the repository's LICENSE file).

Printed values of SLG13 and GLS17 that appear in applications/sjsu/validation/ (for example the
78 coefficients of SLG13 Appendix A and the Table 2 data) are quoted from the cited papers for
comparison only; they are not covered as original data of this dataset.

The model is a reconstruction from the published recipe of M. Sansottera, U. Locatelli and
A. Giorgilli (Math. Comput. Simul. 88 (2013) 1-14) and A. Giorgilli, U. Locatelli and
M. Sansottera (Regul. Chaotic Dyn. 22 (2017) 54-77); please cite those papers as well.
